OL,3,GNEWSAMerseyside's Make a Difference
OL,4,AAwards winners revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "thoughtful" 13-year-old neighbour
OL,7,Fand an "inspiring" veterinary surgeon
OL,8,Fwere among the group of worthy winners
OL,9,Fat the BBC Radio Merseyside Make a
OL,10,FDifference Awards.
OL,12,FThe ceremony featured stories of
OL,13,Fkindness, resilience and dedication at
OL,14,FBoxpark Liverpool on Wednesday.
OL,16,FWinners were announced in eight
OL,17,Fcategories that recognised people who
OL,18,Fgo above and beyond to help others and
OL,19,Fmake a real difference in the
OL,20,Fcommunity.
